msgstr ""
"在 sbt 2.x 中，`test` 任务接受以空格分隔的测试名称列表。例如："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:77
msgid "Here's an example output:"
msgstr ""
"示例输出："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:91
msgid "It supports wildcards as well:"
msgstr ""
"也支持通配符："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:97
msgid "Incremental testing"
msgstr "增量测试"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:99
msgid ""
"In addition to the explicit filter, the `test` task runs only the tests that "
"satisfy one of the following conditions are run:"
msgstr ""
"除显式过滤外，`test` 任务仅运行满足以下条件之一的测试："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:102
msgid "The tests that failed in the previous run"
msgstr ""
"上次运行失败的测试"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:103
msgid "The tests that were not run before"
msgstr ""
"之前未运行过的测试"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:104
msgid ""
"The tests that have one or more transitive dependencies, maybe in a "
"different project, recompiled."
msgstr ""
"有一个或多个传递依赖（可能在不同项目中）被重新编译的测试。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:107
msgid "Full testing"
msgstr "完整测试"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:109
msgid "To run, uncached full tests, like sbt 1.x, use the `testFull` task."
msgstr ""
"要运行未缓存的完整测试（如 sbt 1.x），请使用 `testFull` 任务。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:121
msgid "Other tasks"
msgstr "其他任务"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:123
msgid ""
"Tasks that are available for main sources are generally available for test "
"sources, but are prefixed with `Test /` on the command line and are "
"referenced in Scala code with `Test /` as well. These tasks include:"
msgstr ""
"主源可用的任务通常也可用于测试源，但在命令行中需加 `Test /` 前缀，在 Scala 代码中"
"也以 `Test /` 引用。这些任务包括："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:127
msgid "`Test / compile`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:128
msgid "`Test / console`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:129
msgid "`Test / consoleQuick`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:130
msgid "`Test / run`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:131
msgid "`Test / runMain`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:133
msgid "See [sbt run](./sbt-run.md) for details on these tasks."
msgstr ""
"详见 [sbt run](./sbt-run.md) 了解这些任务。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:135
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:137
msgid ""
"By default, logging is buffered for each test source file until all tests "
"for that file complete. This can be disabled by setting `logBuffered`:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，每个测试源文件的日志会缓冲到该文件所有测试完成。可通过设置 `logBuffered` 禁用："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:145
msgid "Test Reports"
msgstr "测试报告"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:147
msgid ""
"By default, sbt will generate JUnit XML test reports for all tests in the "
"build, located in the `target/test-reports` directory for a project. This "
"can be disabled by disabling the `JUnitXmlReportPlugin`"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，sbt 会为构建中所有测试生成 JUnit XML 测试报告，位于项目的 `target/test-reports` "
"目录。可通过禁用 `JUnitXmlReportPlugin` 来禁用此功能。"

